{"task":"transcribe","language":"English","duration":32.896,"text":" July mein public inke saath thi lekin October ne jab police ne uthaya toh Delhi ne trend karwaya hashtag ThankYouDelhiPolice. Kyun pata hai? Kyuki aam Delhi walo ko subhe kaam pe nikalna hota hai. Har do mahine me 50 metro station bandh karwa hoge, traffic choke karoge toh log taalia thodi bajayenge. Flight se utha rahe the toh co-passengers hass rahe hain. Aur jab beshne bitha ke ye log emergency ki relay bana rahe the, tab inka sabse bada leader Rahul Gandhi Chennai mein Vijay ke saath chill kar raha tha. Aam janta tumhare tamashon se pak chuki hai.","words":[{"word":"July","start":0,"end":0.78},{"word":"mein","start":0.78,"end":1.06},{"word":"public","start":1.06,"end":1.44},{"word":"inke","start":1.44,"end":1.74},{"word":"saath","start":1.74,"end":2.02},{"word":"thi","start":2.02,"end":2.16},{"word":"lekin","start":2.16,"end":2.66},{"word":"October","start":2.66,"end":3.02},{"word":"ne","start":3.02,"end":3.22},{"word":"jab","start":3.22,"end":3.38},{"word":"police","start":3.38,"end":3.6},{"word":"ne","start":3.6,"end":3.76},{"word":"uthaya","start":3.76,"end":4.06},{"word":"toh","start":4.06,"end":4.3},{"word":"Delhi","start":4.3,"end":4.62},{"word":"ne","start":4.62,"end":4.76},{"word":"trend","start":4.76,"end":4.98},{"word":"karwaya","start":4.98,"end":5.38},{"word":"hashtag","start":5.38,"end":5.98},{"word":"ThankYouDelhiPolice.","start":5.98,"end":7.48},{"word":"Kyun","start":7.76,"end":7.88},{"word":"pata","start":7.88,"end":8.22},{"word":"hai?","start":8.22,"end":8.3},{"word":"Kyuki","start":8.3,"end":9.14},{"word":"aam","start":9.14,"end":9.48},{"word":"Delhi","start":9.48,"end":9.76},{"word":"walo","start":9.76,"end":9.98},{"word":"ko","start":9.98,"end":10.22},{"word":"subhe","start":10.22,"end":10.5},{"word":"kaam","start":10.5,"end":10.84},{"word":"pe","start":10.84,"end":10.9},{"word":"nikalna","start":10.9,"end":11.24},{"word":"hota","start":11.24,"end":11.52},{"word":"hai.","st